Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.86,0:00:08.36,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Honjo"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,One, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's 500 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Two for me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.03,0:00:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure! 1,000 yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.58,0:00:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's not even a contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.96,0:00:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure about that.\NGirls, get ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,--Yeah!\N--Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.17,0:00:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.68,0:00:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We made these outfits while\Nyou guys worked on the manga!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.01,0:00:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do whatever it takes to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.98,0:02:16.99,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Shido A Live"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.86,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Circle "Ratatoskr" here!\NPlease line up to buy your copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.95,0:02:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That circle's got a bunch of cute girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not in the catalog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.16,0:02:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? What have we got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.71,0:02:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:35.13,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh? No, I...\N--That's 500 yen, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.13,0:02:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, right... I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that works, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.14,0:02:52.65,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Line Starts Here"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The line starts here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Request! Please form two lines!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It got busy all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.65,0:02:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.07,0:02:59.99,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Sure! Wait, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.16,0:03:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. It's the Ratatoskr crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.24,0:03:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're using shills now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tohka! We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.58,0:03:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is packed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.38,0:03:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm! Thanks for coming, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.71,0:03:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You know it! Since you asked,\NI had to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm! Comico sounded fun, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Even Itsuka's here!\NYou helping Tohka?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.18,0:03:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I feel like the protagonist\Nlooks awfully like Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.94,0:03:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, but it's fiction! Any similarity\Nto real people or events is coincidental!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.78,0:03:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Captain Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.79,0:03:50.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits? A secret organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:52.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.88,0:04:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami? It's rare for you to ask a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.51,0:04:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, Mikie, Mildred...\NThanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.01,0:04:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I feel like I've\Nseen those girls before...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.98,0:04:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.27,0:04:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem different lately, Origami.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.02,0:04:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.48,0:04:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't remember the world\Nbefore I changed history?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No, but we Spirits remember 'cuz we're\Nconnected to you through Spirit power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.50,0:04:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Five boxes left... And her?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use! We'll never win!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. These people want\None thing--a good read.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.35,0:04:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You stood no chance against me in such\Nshort a time, even with your tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.19,0:05:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!\NWe're just getting started!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.87,OS,,0,0,0,,"Miku here~ I'm at Comico doing\Na handshake event at Ratatoskr\N(West A-20/5). Take a photo with me~~~! #comico"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.41,0:05:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.99,0:05:14.50,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Submit"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's actually her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.79,0:05:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! Why is she here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.17,0:05:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we really shake your hand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.72,0:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for all your support,\Neveryone! I-It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.64,0:05:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Miku, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.31,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,But you hate men!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling and everyone else gave their best,\Nso I refuse to stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.07,0:05:48.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stepping up like Natsumi!\NI wanna do my part, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.12,0:05:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Not bad. That girl's famous, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.75,0:05:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. She's our treasured idol.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.17,0:06:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But can you catch up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll win. Not only for\Nour sake, but for yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.72,0:06:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.56,0:06:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe. Only if you win, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Honjo?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.32,0:06:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,T-Takajo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to come when I heard\Nyou were participating.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.17,0:06:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kotori, did you know she'd come?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.25,0:06:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.59,0:06:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to bother you,\Nbut there's something I have to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.59,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I done something to upset you\Nwithout knowing it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.10,0:06:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,If so, I'd like to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Though, even if you hate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.73,0:07:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll always look forward\Nto reading your works.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.12,0:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You like her, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.50,0:07:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! Wh-What are you saying, Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.25,0:07:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't distance yourself\N'cuz you found out her dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just afraid you'll get curious\Nand look someday...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That you'll learn about her dark side.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.89,0:07:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled away,\Nafraid to be let down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.36,0:07:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah! You don't know what\Nyou're talking about, Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.36,0:07:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Five hundred yen, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.74,0:07:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,For hating people,\Nyou sure get along with 'em!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:08:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you shut up?\NFocus on your booth!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.41,0:08:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.96,0:08:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,--Sorry, but no can do!\N--Hey, Shido! Help out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.54,0:08:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna win 'cuz I wanna help you!\NIgnoring the problem ain't gonna help!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's your change!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.22,0:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So what if I'm afraid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.68,0:08:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As if someone who can peep into\Npeople's lives could make friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.60,0:08:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't know till you try!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.14,0:08:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you open your heart\Nto someone who can peep into
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,all your dark secrets and private life?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see you on the toilet or\Nin the bath around the clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,No one will be my friend knowing that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.25,0:08:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's so funny?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.33,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but that doesn't even faze me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.29,0:08:48.29,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Line Starts Here"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Privacy? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.13,0:08:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you're a saint for even caring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.17,0:08:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.01,0:08:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna peep on me, go ahead!\NI'm never gonna hate you for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.39,0:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're down to one copy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido, it's our last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.89,0:09:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,--Thank you!\N--Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.44,0:09:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Ratatoskr: sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Honjo: sold out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:16.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then, it seems we had a tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, fine. Since you guys\Nput up a fight, I'll read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.00,0:09:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:33.63,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Shido A Live"
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.09,0:09:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,A tale about Shido Itsuka\Nsaving Spirits...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better than I thought\Nit would be, but still...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.02,0:09:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It just packs too much in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,With eight Spirits, there're not enough\Npages to like the main character.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not bad\Nconsidering the time crunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.15,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they even make it in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.70,0:10:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanna show that dummy Nia, too:\NThat friends are a wonderful thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.93,0:10:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole story was true?\NEven the things he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.03,0:10:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you think of our manga?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.95,0:10:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. It's all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's a bit naïve to think\NI'd fall for you with just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, since it moved me a little,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with giving you another shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--For crying out loud!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on another date!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.68,0:11:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're a man, make it count!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,--Shido!\N--Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.69,0:11:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.36,0:11:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too early to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.53,0:11:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Boy--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.04,0:11:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nia?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.04,0:11:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The spatial quake alarm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.75,0:11:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia! What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Reine, what's happening?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirit Level: Category E! Nia's inverting!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.00,0:12:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Spatial quake warning. Please evacuate\Nto the nearest shelter immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.05,0:12:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as planned: Sister inverted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.06,0:12:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But why, Ike?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.60,0:12:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,For five years,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.39,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we put Sister through\Nunthinkable physical and mental agony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.90,0:12:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, not once\Ncould we make her invert.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Before us, Sister had already\Nlost her faith in humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.12,0:12:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I allowed her to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.62,0:12:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the micro Realizer\Nyou planted in her brain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:13:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Was to make her forget\Neverything we did to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.46,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But the instant she opened up to Shido\Nand regained her trust in humanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,she remembered\Nfive terrible years of suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just like glass--the higher the fall,\Nthe easier it breaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.77,0:13:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, too.\NLend Ellen a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.53,0:13:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.62,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,--That's--!\N--Careful, Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.50,0:13:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from her Demon King.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.60,0:13:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Metatron!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.85,0:14:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever this is, we can't let it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.27,0:14:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us take care of these\Nwhile you get to Nia and--!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.03,0:14:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I can't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.45,0:14:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:19.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Given your timing, I take it\Nyou guys are responsible for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.04,0:14:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Demon King's power is troublesome.\NLet's finish this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.47,0:14:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaguya, Yuzuru, and Miku take Ellen!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Origami, Yoshino, and Natsumi help Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.43,0:14:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,--Right!\N--Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.56,0:14:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.65,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's this? I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.82,0:14:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Future Entry!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me! Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are in our way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:02.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Haniel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.35,0:15:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.31,0:15:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.90,0:15:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Future Entry again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.11,0:15:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.49,0:15:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido used Zadkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.71,0:15:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can move?! Oh, I get it!\N'Cuz that wasn't written down?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I can fight! Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... If I use Miku's Gabriel...!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.53,0:16:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Shi... do...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.07,0:16:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang on! I'm gonna save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.91,0:16:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.33,0:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.83,0:16:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you here, Artemisia Ashcroft?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Artemisia?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.73,0:16:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Isaac Westcott?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.78,0:16:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Long time no see, Shido Itsuka.\NI'm glad you're doing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.66,0:17:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's marvelous!\NA crystal of inverted Spirit power--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.00,0:17:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Qlipha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.75,0:17:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,At last, I take one great stride\Ntowards my deepest desires!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.98,0:17:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,No way! He absorbed a Sephirah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.03,0:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Shido Itsuka.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.95,0:17:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you gained\Nthe powers of eight Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.33,0:17:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Beelzebub.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.13,0:17:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Just by touching a Demon King,\Nyou know exactly how to use its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ike!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.89,0:18:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen, behold one of the majestic\NDemon Kings which shall light our path!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.90,0:18:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But one is simply not enough\Nto satisfy our ambitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.45,0:18:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shido! You okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.16,0:18:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah! But Nia was...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.00,0:18:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ellen, we achieved our goal.\NLet's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.55,0:18:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.01,0:18:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my body will struggle to absorb\Nmultiple Demon Kings at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, it would be such a waste\Nnot to savor them one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We will meet again soon,\NShido Itsuka... and Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.70,0:19:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, I'll make you invert\Nand take your Qlipha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.70,0:19:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to enjoy your final days of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.58,0:19:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.38,0:19:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia! Nia! Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.88,0:19:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Shido! It's faint,\Nbut I sense her Spirit power!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.93,0:19:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.14,0:19:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just before she was stabbed,\Nyou pulled part of her consciousness back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,At that point,\Nshe wasn't fully inverted anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably has a fragment\Nof Sephirah left in her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.07,0:19:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you can seal her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.36,0:19:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Nia! Open your heart to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.78,0:19:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you use\Nall my power, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.83,0:19:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your eyes, Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.09,0:20:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,--Nia!\N--Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.47,0:20:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.68,0:20:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to shout. I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.57,0:20:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank... you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:21:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,First sunrise of the year!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.59,0:22:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Boy... Thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.84,0:22:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.\NEveryone's been helping me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.22,0:22:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I had time to think while I recovered...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.73,0:22:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I wanna talk to Takajo again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.94,0:22:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you should.\NShe's a good person, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.19,0:22:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,"Probably"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.40,0:22:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's weird. It stinks that my power was\Ntaken, but I'm kinda at peace with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.79,0:22:38.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I had Raziel for, like, 30 years,\Nbut maybe the power's too much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.83,0:22:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty years? You became\Na Spirit that long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.71,0:22:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 27 or 28 to be precise.\NDon't I look good for my age?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.39,0:22:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Spirit power probably\Nhalted your aging.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.76,0:22:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, you'll age normally,\Nso watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.52,0:23:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way...\NWhen did you guys become Spirits?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Five years ago for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.98,0:23:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I did about one year ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.40,0:23:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I did recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.07,0:23:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest of us are Pure Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.49,0:23:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"Pure Spirits"?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But Spirits were all humans\Nin the beginning, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.75,0:23:25.00,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 03:\N'What's Yours Is Mine.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.05,0:23:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See the sky! See the stars! See Mukuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a new Spirit, floating in the cosmos!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.05,0:23:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time: "Space Spirit."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.18,0:23:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When Earth is in trouble,\NShido will rise! Shido will fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.85,0:23:41.54,On Top,,0,0,0,,"Episode 04: 'Space Spirit.'"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.54,0:23:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.53,0:23:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,
